### Okwu Couriers API: sample requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman / Thunder Client.
### You can also test everything at http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = paste-your-access-token-here

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ada Obi", "email": "ada@example.com", "password": "StrongPass1"}

### Login (copy access_token into @token above)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ada@example.com", "password": "StrongPass1"}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create parcel (expect price 3700)
POST {{base}}/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sender_name": "Ada Obi", "recipient_name": "Chinedu Okafor", "recipient_phone": "08031234567",
 "origin_city": "Awka", "destination_city": "Enugu", "weight_kg": 2.3}

### Invalid parcel (expect 422)
POST {{base}}/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sender_name": "Ada Obi", "recipient_name": "Chinedu Okafor", "recipient_phone": "12345",
 "origin_city": "Lagos", "destination_city": "Enugu", "weight_kg": 0}

### List my parcels
GET {{base}}/parcels?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one parcel
GET {{base}}/parcels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change status (allowed)
PATCH {{base}}/parcels/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "PICKED_UP", "note": "Picked up at Awka office"}

### Change status (not allowed, expect 409)
PATCH {{base}}/parcels/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DELIVERED"}

### Delete (only while CREATED)
DELETE {{base}}/parcels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public tracking (no token; replace with a real code)
GET {{base}}/track/OKW-XXXXXXXX
